---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Docs — the Pulse way" description="A clear, native-first guide to installing and shipping PulseUI.">
  <section class="docs-hero">
    <div class="container docs-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><b>Documentation</b>&nbsp;·&nbsp;the Pulse way</span>
        <h1 class="display">Less setup.<br /><span class="outline-text">More signal.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">PulseUI is a source-owned SwiftUI system. You choose the language of your interface, the CLI puts the exact pieces in your project, and you stay in control.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/studio/">Open the Studio <span>→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/install/">Installation guide <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="signal-orbit" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="orbit orbit-a"></div><div class="orbit orbit-b"></div>
        <div class="orbit-core"><span></span><b>native</b><small>SwiftUI</small></div>
        <i class="orbit-node node-a"></i><i class="orbit-node node-b"></i><i class="orbit-node node-c"></i>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container docs-flow">
    <div class="flow-intro"><span class="section-index">01</span><h2>From blank project<br /><em>to pulse.</em></h2><p>No package archaeology. No folder choreography. The CLI reads the project you already have and prepares the native path.</p></div>
    <div class="flow-steps">
      <article class="flow-step"><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h3>Initialize once</h3><p>Run the installer, then initialize from the folder that contains your Xcode project.</p><code>pulse init --accent '#D9FE3E' --radius 10</code></div></article>
      <article class="flow-step"><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h3>Pick only what matters</h3><p>Add source-owned components. Their dependencies are resolved for you and the app target is kept buildable.</p><code>pulse add button table chart</code></div></article>
      <article class="flow-step"><span class="step-number">03</span><div><h3>Compose, don't configure</h3><p>Use the public SwiftUI API directly. The theme is already attached at the app root and remains yours to edit.</p><code>ContentView().pulseTheme(pulse)</code></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="principles">
    <div class="container principles-shell">
      <div class="principles-heading">
        <span class="section-index">02 / principles</span>
        <h2>The system has<br /><em>a point of view.</em></h2>
        <p>Three decisions keep PulseUI expressive, native and genuinely useful in production.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-stage" data-principles>
        <div class="principle-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="PulseUI principles">
          <button class="principle-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="principle-native" data-principle="native"><span>01</span><b>Native</b></button>
          <button class="principle-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="principle-glass" data-principle="glass"><span>02</span><b>Intentional</b></button>
          <button class="principle-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="principle-source" data-principle="source"><span>03</span><b>Owned</b></button>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-panel is-active" id="principle-native" role="tabpanel">
          <div class="panel-art art-native"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><div class="art-label">SwiftUI<br /><b>by default</b></div></div>
          <div class="panel-copy"><span class="panel-kicker">The foundation</span><h3>It speaks the platform.</h3><p>Pulse components feel at home because they use SwiftUI primitives and platform behavior first. Dynamic Type, VoiceOver, keyboard navigation and Reduce Motion are built into the API.</p><div class="panel-meta"><span>iOS</span><span>iPadOS</span><span>macOS</span><span>visionOS</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-panel" id="principle-glass" role="tabpanel" hidden>
          <div class="panel-art art-glass"><i></i><i></i><div class="art-label">Glass<br /><b>with intent</b></div></div>
          <div class="panel-copy"><span class="panel-kicker">The restraint</span><h3>Material is a role, not a costume.</h3><p>Liquid Glass is reserved for navigation, toolbars, menus, floating actions and transient UI. Content stays sharp, calm and fast to scan.</p><div class="panel-meta"><span>Focus</span><span>Depth</span><span>Motion</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-panel" id="principle-source" role="tabpanel" hidden>
          <div class="panel-art art-source"><div class="source-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="art-label">Your code<br /><b>your rules</b></div></div>
          <div class="panel-copy"><span class="panel-kicker">The promise</span><h3>Nothing disappears behind a runtime.</h3><p>Pulse copies the source into your project. Inspect it, tune it, ship it. No opaque generator, no hidden design layer, no lock-in.</p><div class="panel-meta"><span>Copy-paste</span><span>Editable</span><span>Open</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container docs-end">
    <span class="section-index">03</span>
    <h2>Ready when<br /><em>your idea is.</em></h2>
    <p>Browse every component, tune the system in Studio, then ship the smallest useful surface.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/components/">Explore components <span>→</span></a>
  </section>
</Base>

<script is:inline>
  const principleRoot = document.querySelector("[data-principles]");
  if (principleRoot) {
    const tabs = [...principleRoot.querySelectorAll("[data-principle]")];
    const panels = [...principleRoot.querySelectorAll(".principle-panel")];
    const activate = (name) => {
      tabs.forEach((tab) => {
        const active = tab.dataset.principle === name;
        tab.classList.toggle("is-active", active);
        tab.setAttribute("aria-selected", String(active));
      });
      panels.forEach((panel) => {
        const active = panel.id === `principle-${name}`;
        panel.classList.toggle("is-active", active);
        panel.hidden = !active;
      });
    };
    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {
      tab.addEventListener("click", () => activate(tab.dataset.principle));
      tab.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
        if (!["ArrowRight", "ArrowDown", "ArrowLeft", "ArrowUp"].includes(event.key)) return;
        event.preventDefault();
        const next = tabs[(index + (event.key === "ArrowRight" || event.key === "ArrowDown" ? 1 : -1) + tabs.length) % tabs.length];
        next.focus();
        activate(next.dataset.principle);
      });
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .docs-hero { padding: clamp(64px, 11vw, 140px) 0 100px; overflow: hidden; }
  .docs-hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, .75fr); gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
  .docs-hero h1 { margin-top: 16px; font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 8vw, 7.2rem); line-height: .92; }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 530px; margin: 24px 0 28px; color: var(--fg-secondary); font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .text-link { color: var(--fg-secondary); font-size: 14px; }
  .text-link span { color: var(--accent-ink); margin-left: 6px; }
  .signal-orbit { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1; max-width: 430px; justify-self: end; }
  .orbit { position: absolute; inset: 14%; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 32%, transparent); border-radius: 50%; animation: orbit-spin 18s linear infinite; }
  .orbit-b { inset: 27%; border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 18%, transparent); animation-direction: reverse; animation-duration: 12s; }
  .orbit-core { position: absolute; inset: 34%; display: grid; place-content: center; text-align: center; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 48%, var(--border)); border-radius: 50%; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, var(--panel)); box-shadow: 0 0 70px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 20%, transparent); animation: core-pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .orbit-core span { width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 0 auto 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--accent); }
  .orbit-core b { font: 700 12px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .orbit-core small { margin-top: 4px; color: var(--fg-tertiary); font-size: 11px; }
  .orbit-node { position: absolute; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--accent); }
  .node-a { top: 11%; left: 54%; }.node-b { right: 14%; bottom: 27%; }.node-c { left: 16%; bottom: 22%; }
  @keyframes orbit-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  @keyframes core-pulse { 50% { transform: scale(1.035); box-shadow: 0 0 100px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 28%, transparent); } }
  .docs-flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .7fr 1.3fr; gap: 80px; padding-bottom: 120px; }
  .section-index { color: var(--accent-ink); font: 11px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .flow-intro h2, .principles h2, .docs-end h2 { margin: 15px 0 18px; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  h2 em { color: var(--accent-ink); font-style: normal; }
  .flow-intro p, .docs-end p { max-width: 310px; color: var(--fg-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
  .flow-steps { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .flow-step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); transition: transform .3s var(--motion-snappy); }
  .flow-step:hover { transform: translateX(8px); }
  .step-number { color: var(--accent-ink); font: 12px var(--font-mono); }
  .flow-step h3 { margin: 0 0 7px; font-size: 1.2rem; }.flow-step p { margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--fg-secondary); line-height: 1.55; }
  code { display: inline-block; max-width: 100%; overflow: auto; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; color: var(--accent-ink); background: var(--surface-muted); font: 11px var(--font-mono); white-space: nowrap; }
  .principles { padding: 110px 0; background: var(--bg-soft); border-block: 1px solid var(--border); overflow: hidden; }
  .principles-shell { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .65fr 1.35fr; gap: clamp(36px, 7vw, 100px); align-items: center; }
  .principles-heading h2 { margin: 16px 0; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); line-height: .96; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .principles-heading p { max-width: 270px; color: var(--fg-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
  .principle-stage { min-width: 0; }
  .principle-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .principle-tab { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 9px 13px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; color: var(--fg-tertiary); background: transparent; cursor: pointer; font: 12px var(--font-body); transition: color .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease, transform .2s var(--motion-snappy); }
  .principle-tab span { color: var(--accent-ink); font: 10px var(--font-mono); }
  .principle-tab:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); color: var(--fg); border-color: var(--border-strong); }
  .principle-tab.is-active { color: var(--fg); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 50%, var(--border)); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, var(--panel)); }
  .principle-panel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(170px, .7fr) 1.3fr; gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 48px); align-items: center; min-height: 320px; padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 42px); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: 24px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--panel) 72%, transparent); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); animation: panel-in .42s var(--motion-snappy) both; }
  .panel-copy { min-width: 0; }.panel-kicker { color: var(--accent-ink); font: 10px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .panel-copy h3 { margin: 13px 0 10px; font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .panel-copy p { margin: 0; color: var(--fg-secondary); line-height: 1.65; }
  .panel-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; margin-top: 22px; }.panel-meta span { padding: 6px 9px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 7px; color: var(--fg-tertiary); font: 10px var(--font-mono); }
  .panel-art { position: relative; min-height: 220px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 34%, var(--border)); border-radius: 18px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 7%, var(--bg)); }
  .panel-art .art-label { position: absolute; left: 18px; bottom: 16px; color: var(--fg-tertiary); font: 11px/1.35 var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }.art-label b { color: var(--fg); }
  .art-native i { position: absolute; left: 25%; width: 50%; height: 10px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--accent); opacity: .8; animation: native-bars 2.8s ease-in-out infinite; }.art-native i:nth-child(1) { top: 30%; }.art-native i:nth-child(2) { top: 42%; width: 35%; }.art-native i:nth-child(3) { top: 54%; width: 44%; animation-delay: .15s; }.art-native i:nth-child(4) { top: 66%; width: 27%; animation-delay: .3s; }
  .art-glass i { position: absolute; width: 105px; height: 105px; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, transparent); border-radius: 28px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 13%, transparent); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); transform: rotate(28deg); animation: glass-float 4s ease-in-out infinite; }.art-glass i:first-child { top: 28%; left: 20%; }.art-glass i:nth-child(2) { top: 12%; left: 48%; width: 80px; height: 80px; animation-delay: -.9s; }
  .source-lines { position: absolute; inset: 28px 24px 56px; display: grid; gap: 12px; align-content: center; }.source-lines i { display: block; height: 7px; width: 90%; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--accent); opacity: .7; }.source-lines i:nth-child(2) { width: 65%; }.source-lines i:nth-child(3) { width: 78%; }.source-lines i:nth-child(4) { width: 42%; }
  @keyframes panel-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } } @keyframes native-bars { 50% { transform: translateX(12px); opacity: .45; } } @keyframes glass-float { 50% { transform: rotate(36deg) translate(10px, -8px); } }
  .docs-end { padding: 130px 0 40px; }.docs-end p { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .docs-hero-grid, .docs-flow, .principles-shell { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 44px; }.signal-orbit { justify-self: center; width: min(100%, 350px); }.docs-flow { padding-bottom: 80px; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .principles { padding: 76px 0; }.principle-tabs { overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 3px; scrollbar-width: none; }.principle-tab { flex: 0 0 auto; }.principle-panel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: 0; padding: 18px; }.panel-art { min-height: 190px; }.panel-copy h3 { font-size: 1.9rem; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .orbit, .orbit-core, .principle-panel, .art-native i, .art-glass i { animation: none; }.flow-step:hover, .principle-tab:hover { transform: none; } }
</style>
